WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.771
Choosing a health plan can feel like a guess.

2
00:00:04.191 --> 00:00:08.485
HerePup helps you decide with something you already have: your own claims.

3
00:00:08.905 --> 00:00:11.786
Let's walk through it together, one step at a time.

4
00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.395
First, tell HerePup who's on your coverage.

5
00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.660
First names are perfectly fine.

6
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.147
Just mark each person as an adult, or a child.

7
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.112
Next, upload each employer's benefit guide.

8
00:00:25.532 --> 00:00:34.255
HerePup reads every plan option for you: the deductibles, the out-of-pocket limits, the copays, and what each one costs per paycheck.

9
00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:37.116
You can check, and change, every number.

10
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:43.460
If a plan comes with a health savings account, HerePup will ask what your employer puts in.

11
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.657
Guides often leave it out, and it can change the answer, so it's worth a moment.

12
00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.388
Then, bring in your claims.

13
00:00:51.808 --> 00:00:58.522
You can upload the statements your insurer sends you, or connect to your insurer, and sign in on their own page.

14
00:00:58.942 --> 00:01:04.253
HerePup never sees your password, and it can only read your records, never change them.

15
00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:13.498
First, HerePup works out what kind of care each claim was, like a specialist visit, a trip to urgent care, or a prescription.

16
00:01:13.918 --> 00:01:17.009
Then it shows how each one would land under every plan.

17
00:01:17.429 --> 00:01:21.089
A small copay on one, and the full deductible on another.

18
00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:30.421
And here's your answer: the choice that would have cost your household the least, with premiums, care, and employer savings all counted in.

19
00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:36.954
Slide to imagine a lighter, or a busier year, and HerePup will tell you if the best choice would change.

20
00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.581
Through all of this, your information stays on your own computer.

21
00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:47.202
It's never sold, or shared, and you can delete everything, any time, with a single click.

22
00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.727
No guesswork. Just your own story, told clearly.

23
00:01:52.147 --> 00:01:55.043
HerePup. Pick your plan, with confidence.

